    "390": {
      "date": "2026-09-21",
      "edition": "Monday 21 September",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "WXV Global Series",
          "heading": "Scotland women suffer heavy 66-14 defeat against dominant New Zealand side",
          "body": "The Scotland women's team conceded 10 tries in a challenging 66-14 defeat to New Zealand at Hive Stadium. Despite the scoreline, Evie Gallagher provided some attacking spark for the hosts, crossing for two first-half tries to keep Scotland in contention at 24-14. However, the world number two side controlled the remainder of the match with relentless pace and clinical finishing. Scotland will look to regroup before facing Australia at the same venue in their next WXV fixture."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
