          "kicker": "Coaching vacancy",
          "heading": "UAR continues search for permanent head coach as vacancy remains open",
          "body": "The search for a permanent head coach for Los Pumas remains unresolved as the Argentine Rugby Union continues its evaluation process. While recent media reports have linked Jacques Nienaber to the position, there has been no confirmation of an appointment or formal agreement. The role remains vacant following previous cycles, and the union has yet to provide an official update regarding their preferred candidate or a timeline for when an announcement might be expected."
